# Coverage reports are output, not source.
coverage

# On a screenshot mismatch Vitest writes the actual and the diff here. Output.
#
# `src/components/__screenshots__` is deliberately NOT ignored: those PNGs are
# the approved baselines the `visual` project compares against, so they are
# source. Ignoring them would make every fresh clone generate its own baseline
# on first run and pass — a gate that can never fail.
.vitest-attachments

# Each example app builds into its own root.
examples/*/dist
